-# Parallax Capture 0.5.3 — Render-camera / ReplayMod capture
+# Parallax Capture 0.5.4 — ReplayMod hotkey fix
 
 Fabric 1.20.1 client mod for spatial screenshots (beauty + depth + surface-depth24).
 
 ## What changed
 
+**0.5.4:** F8 now has a direct GLFW edge-detection fallback in the render loop, so ReplayMod contextual keybinding filtering cannot swallow the capture trigger. The normal Fabric keybinding remains registered and both paths are deduplicated.
+
+
 F8 capture no longer teleports or rotates the networked player. The 3x3/5x5 capture grid is applied only to Minecraft's **render Camera**. This means:
 
 - no OP permission or `/tp` command is required;
